1
00:00:00,272 --> 00:00:01,692
[VIDEO GAME PLAYING]

2
00:00:01,856 --> 00:00:05,946
Ha-ha. Eat my dust,
racially stereotypical plumber.

3
00:00:08,905 --> 00:00:11,495
(Sheldon:)That's not fair.
I got stuck behind a tree.

4
00:00:11,658 --> 00:00:13,448
(Raj:)And a cow and a penguin.

5
00:00:14,619 --> 00:00:19,999
(Raj:)Face it, dude, whether it's a real car
or a virtual cartoon car, you can't drive.

6
00:00:20,292 --> 00:00:23,502
(Sheldon:)-Just need a little more practice.
-What you need is cheat codes...

7
00:00:23,670 --> 00:00:26,050
...motor skills and a genie
who grants wishes...

8
00:00:26,214 --> 00:00:28,844
(Raj:)...to little boys
who suck at "Mario Kart."

9
00:00:29,801 --> 00:00:30,841
[KNOCK ON DOOR]

10
00:00:31,970 --> 00:00:33,890
(Leonard:)Sheldon,
can I talk to you for a second?

11
00:00:34,055 --> 00:00:36,475
(Sheldon:)It's not about shoes, is it?

12
00:00:36,641 --> 00:00:38,681
(Bernadette:)I don't think
I could go through that again.

13
00:00:38,852 --> 00:00:41,482
(Sheldon:)-It's not about shoes.
-Then speak.

14
00:00:41,646 --> 00:00:45,026
(Penny:)-Um, actually, can we do it in private?
-All right.

15
00:00:45,984 --> 00:00:47,524
(Sheldon:)Go away.

16
00:00:49,362 --> 00:00:52,202
(Sheldon:)I agree, it's rude,
but she asked for privacy.

17
00:00:53,241 --> 00:00:57,021
(Penny:)Thanks, Raj.
Okay, so here's the thing.

